              Station  : Hong Kong-B,Quarry Bay    Latitude:  22 18.0N          
              Country  : China                    Longitude: 114 13.0E          
              JASL #   : 329B                 Time Meridian: 120E (GMT + 8 hr)  
              GLOSS #  : 077  Originator #: OHQUB    NODC #: 12112402
              Contributor  : Hong Kong Observatory
                             134A Nathan Road, Kowloon   
                             Hong Kong                                          
              Originator   : same                                               
              Original Data: analog                                             
              Instrmnt Type: mechanical (float type) tide gauge                 
              Digitzd Intvl: one hour                                           
              Present Data : Hourly, daily, and monthly values obtained by:     
                    Hourly : the one-minute average on the hour is taken
                             as the mean hourly tide data
                    Daily  : 119-point convolution filter (Bloomfield, 1976)    
                             centered on noon applied to the hourly data        
                             with respective periods of the 95, 50, and 5%      
                             amplitude points at 124.0, 60.2, and 40.2 hours    
                    Monthly: Simple average of all daily values; calculated if  
                             7 or fewer days are missing                        
              Span of data : 01 Jan 1986 - 31 Dec 2018
              Gaps > 1 mon : none                                               
              Time Refernce: GMT (00-23 hours)   Space-filler Flag   :-9999     
              Units        : millimeters         Missing Data Flag   : 9999     
              Existing     : Yes                 Operational         : Yes      
              Sat. Trans.  : No                  Distribution        : 1986-2018
              Refernce Levl: The data are assumed to have been corrected to     
                             tide staff zero or fixed bench marks by the        
                             originators.  This series is at a different
                             location than 329A (North Point) and has not
                             been geodetically survey to the same datum.
              Comment      : The residuals (observed minus predicted data)      
                             contain a high degree of noise with periods of 3   
                             to 8 hours.  This may be due to the insufficient   
                             approximation of the observed data by the tidal    
                             analysis.  The residuals contain fluctuations      
                             of up to 75 cm with periods of 1 to 3              
                             days associated with meteorological events.        
                             Otherwise, the daily and monthly means             
                             do not reveal any reference level shifts or        
                             obvious problems.                                  
                                                                                
